== 6a. KILL SWITCH, level 1: gateway-wide lockdown (every sandbox, one command) ==
$ openshell policy set --global --policy ./policies/lockdown.yaml --yes
✓ Global policy configured (hash: 1b621527d93a, settings revision: 31)
